 :buffer-exports
  {:title "array's buffer exports: a resize while a memoryview holds the array"
   :kind :deferred
   :owner "PY7"
   :why "arraymodule.c counts the buffers an array exports and refuses a resize (BufferError) while one is held; a memoryview releases its export when its count reaches zero, which pyi's tracing GC cannot tell (PYS9): counting exports without that release would make every later resize fail. PY6d (builtins_array.go) holds the count's place; PY7 decides with finalization"
   :decided "survey §6.5, PYS9; PY6d's report (queue 200)"
   :match [#"^failure BufferError not raised"]}
